# Agent runtime (platform)

Full map: **`docs/AGENT_RUNTIME.md`**.

## Non-negotiables

- Claude = **headless CLI** (`askClaude` / `services/claude.ts`), not Anthropic Messages API.
- Customer tools = text `<tool_call>` + backend execution (`tool-definitions.ts`, `agent-tools-prompt.ts`).
- Within a turn, tool follow-ups pass `resumeSessionId` (stream-json) for `--resume` + slim prompt when the **same** model continues; mid-turn prompt activate or router↔reply model switch clears the session.
- Tenant reply model = **sonnet \| opus** only (`normalizeClaudeReplyModel`). Internal tool-routing uses `CLAUDE_ROUTER_MODEL` (haiku); final customer prose always uses the reply model.
- CRM only via `getCrmAdapter` + `resolveCrmProvider(action)` — never HTTP in `conversation.ts`.
- Platform capability map lives in `lib/platform-capabilities-prompt.ts` — inject into **meta-agent** and **insights (AI-помічник)**. Keep in sync when changing modes/tools/CRM.
- Spawn CWD is isolated (`claude-spawn-cwd`) — tenant disk `CLAUDE.md` is **not** the customer system prompt; DB `system_prompts` + runtime injections are.
- Telegram manager alerts are **side effects**, not a customer-facing tool.

## Admin assistants

| Nav | Purpose |
|-----|---------|
